Automatic Gate Opening using RFID & NFC (ESP32)

An ESP32-based automatic gate/parking access control system using RFID (RC522) card 
detection for member and visitor vehicle management — inspired by real mall/parking entry-exit workflows.

Overview
This project automates gate entry and exit for a parking/access system by reading RFID/NFC cards, 
checking membership status against a database, and triggering a relay-controlled gate. 
It supports both registered members and walk-in visitors, with separate logic paths for each.
